# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# Local configuration that may name hosts or carry an allowlist.
# Nothing secret should ever live here -- capability comes from the process
# environment, never from a file -- but a host-specific config is still noise
# in a shared repo.
config.local.json

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Generated semantic indexes. Rebuildable with `vault_index.py build`, and
# several MB of float vectors apiece -- a build artefact, not source. The
# vectors are also only valid for the embedding model and prefixes that made
# them, so a committed index goes stale invisibly. An index also contains the
# text of everything it indexed, so committing one publishes the corpus.
#
# Scoped to the repo root, not `**`, so that example or fixture JSON in a
# subdirectory is still trackable rather than silently disappearing.
/*.json
